==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{form|Eiscue|Ice Face}} {{p|Eiscue}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Rebel Clash|Eiscue|54}} from the {{TCG|Rebel Clash}} expansion.
*{{a|Ice Face}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Eiscue can have.
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

